  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Program for Macroeconomic and Fiscal Sustainability</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Emergencia para la Sostenibilidad Macroeconomica y Fiscal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es apoyar las politicas que el Gobierno de Honduras est implementando para enfrentar la pandemia del COVID-19, con miras a preservar la estabilidad macroeconmica y la sostenibilidad fiscal.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to support the policies that the Government of Honduras is implementing to address the COVID-19 pandemic, with a view to preserve macroeconomic stability and fiscal sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
